    "q-104916": {
      "dom_id": "step-q104916",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "Which of the following sets is a subset of $A=\\{\\{12\\},\\{20,22\\},\\{6,9,15\\}\\}?$\n\nI. $\\{-1,\\{12\\}\\}$\n\nII. $\\{\\{20,22\\}\\}$\n\nIII. $\\{\\{0\\},\\{6,9,15\\}\\}$",
      "worked_solution": "A set is a subset of $A$ if all its elements are elements of $A.$ \n\nWith that in mind, let's inspect each option.\n\n- $\\{-1,\\{12\\}\\}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element $-1\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\n- $\\{\\{20,22\\}\\}$ is a subset of $A.\\,✓$\n\n- $\\{\\{0\\},\\{6,9,15\\}\\}$ is *not* a subset of $A$ because it contains the element $\\{0\\}\\notin A.\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\".",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
