      "name": "Question 3",
      "problem": "Which set is a subset of $A=\\{a,c,e\\}?$",
      "worked_solution": "A set is a subset of $A$ if all its elements are elements of $A.$\n\nOf the given sets, only $\\{a\\}$ has all of its elements in $A.$\n\nTherefore, $\\{a\\}$ is a subset of $A.$",
