      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Which of the following sets is a subset of $A=\\{1,2,3,4\\}?$",
      "worked_solution": "A set is a subset of $A$ if all its elements are elements of $A.$\n\nNotice that the empty set $\\{\\}$ is a subset of any set.\n\nTherefore, $\\{\\}$ is a subset of $A.$",
